# SPA DRAG — homepage is static index.html
File: website/audit/spa-drag.oot

Verdict: PASS. Live home is static `index.html`. The hash-router
SPA under `src/` is gone so it cannot overwrite the home body.
Refreshed 2026-09-15: constellation names `cli`. No new SPA.

## 1. Homepage

`index.html` is the public home. Install box and product
constellation (including `cli`) are real HTML. No-JS and
crawlers see that body. There is no `#content` fetch and no
`/docs/*.oot` route table.

`404.html` is a static miss page. It does not load `src/`.

## 2. Retired SPA

`src/anchor.oo` is a tombstone. Do not add `theme/`, `route/`,
`sky/`, or a dogfight. Do not invent a new SPA framework.

Live enhancement is `js/copy.js`, `js/rotate.js`, `js/panels.js`.
Those are not a router.

## 3. WASM residue

No WASM module loads from this repo. `window.wasmActive` is
not read.

## 4. Product constellation (home)

Strategic: openOODA.
Operational: ooda, cli, tui, install, opm, catalog, lsp, mcp, bb.
Tactical: oodac, oodar, std.
website and .github are table-only.

